    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. We should be safe here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "text": "Cador, it's still a mess outside. We're most certainly not in Londinium anymore. I reckon we can see the situation outside the plate from the top of the old loading tower, but I can't get near it. It's outside the restricted area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I reckon even if you could spot anything, it wouldn't mean a thing. The Sarkaz keep a close eye, and... there are too many of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what's the old bloke's story?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, he was trying to talk terms with the Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how did that turn out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g1_glasgowboxinggym",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There. That's about all I can do, bandaging your wound.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank... Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodness... Why... Just what happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What else could've happened? The Sarkaz have been in Londinium for four years now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't possibly still think they were invited here by that poor sod Cavendish as his guests, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they haven't ever...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haven't ever what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must be one of those noblemen who never leave their mansions and need their maids to fetch them their morning cystymilk. How'd you fall so low as to find yourself in Norport?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, I'm but a scholar. I have merely run into certain... troubles financially. As soon as I finish my manuscript, I shall...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Drat! The manuscript is still in my study!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird, you've really got a knack for finding these poor, down-on-their-luck bastards, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you at least have some respect? If all goes well, it's very likely I will become the Royal Academy of Sciences' next academician!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Very likely.' Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still don't understand. The news kept saying that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'All is well.' What more do you want them to say? 'Friends and citizens, I sincerely regret to inform you that Londinium is now a shithole?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'special instructors' that they sent to the newspaper offices and TV stations actually earned their keep, you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see whose flag they're flying above the munitions factory in Highbury? If not, you've got to at least remember the fire in Auchterigg the other day, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the war... What about the Defense Forces? The dukes? Aren't they defending us all around Londinium?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can this be...? The Sarkaz can't possibly triumph over the dukes, can they? The devils are a bunch of savages who cower in the wilderness, but Victoria is the greatest country across all the lands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who told you that? Did you realize that out of nowhere while munching on cake at home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't feel that way at all when the dibbles held me up against the wall and frisked me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, 'Next Academician,' off you go. You don't belong here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... where can I go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "My flat is not in this lockdown zone, and I haven't the slightest idea where my loyal servant is... I know no one here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What can you do? Medical work, sewing, repair, anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "M-My research is in heraldry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You scholarly chaps ever studied how to turn air into steaks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... it is by no means my area of expertise, but I'd imagine it's a little difficult...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird, stop bringing these fancy lads back, will ya? He doesn't even understand sarcasm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have a lot of supplies on hand here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... Maybe he can help Delphine manage the warehouse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_runstop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#3$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird! Stop trying to pass all your problems to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't very well watch him die on the street.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "At times like this, we have to come together and unite as one. Even having one extra man on board is more power to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Come together...' *sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish Parliament and the dukes would learn from you people. We wouldn't have fallen to where we are today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think they're not united enough? They were all very united when it came to hanging the king.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was... *sigh*, never mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just hope you'll be of some use, Mr. 'Next Academician.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shall do everything in my power! Though, speaking of which... who would all of you be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, welcome to our gym, the 'Slobberknocker'!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_862_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can call us Glasgow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
