    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_penrustle",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Heidi, how have you been?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "To tell the truth, I haven't any idea where you have been as of late. Ever since Mr. Adams the bookshop owner died, I haven't been able to reach you.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It has been a long time since I last continued our work.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Forgive me, my dear friend. I never hide anything from you.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But I am truly very... befuddled.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You once told me that peace would come again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I can't fool myself with false hope anymore. I can't hide in my room and pretend that everything we do is still meaningful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, we could look at things on a broader scale. 'The dimension of history...'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, peace will come. It will, eventually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "And war will undoubtedly shatter it in an even crueler way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I once thought we could win, and I still hope that we will win.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Heidi, if everything that we have done amounts to nothing but self-comfort...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not 'if.' This might already be the truth...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "These books, these desks, and this school that may come crumbling down at any moment... How are they meant to stand up against the force of a new era?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heidi, I can't... I can't keep going anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "What should I do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Golding, are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Molly... you're back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you writing a letter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, this is nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I just remembered a few novels that I read before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "The protagonists are always charming, suave, always heading to the frontlines wearing a uniform befitting of them with a pipe in their mouths.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the authors never tell us which battlefield they head to and how the trenches smell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those who are enamored of the protagonist, both women and men, taste fine desserts with anxious hearts\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, we all know these are just literary techniques. The stories always end happily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Authors with a little bit of ambition might try to build what the critics call a 'profound' atmosphere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "The stories are adorned with preventable deaths, and they are always the protagonist's comrade and dearest friend, dying in the trenches to shield the hero.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, the wretched enemy finds themselves defeated by the hero's sword, thus restoring justice and morality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "And at his fallen friend's funeral, a solemn crowd gathers to remember his heroics, as petals symbolizing honor are scattered atop the casket.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the most emotional part. The protagonist clenches his fist, wipes his tears, and looks toward the morning sun with resolve\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And without fail, they always say that hope will come and all sacrifices will be meaningful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there. That's where the author stops. Let the readers imagine for themselves that truly beautiful future. Let them bask in that stately feeling in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm surprised you read these kinds of novels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was years ago. Everyone was that age once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to be obsessed with these books when I was still a young girl... I wasn't very attached to the protagonists, actually, but I was indeed obsessed with those deaths.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes, I imagined myself one of those heroes who sacrificed themselves for their cause, and the masses would sing my praises for the era I helped create or, at the very least, my sacrifice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. How childish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Later on, I thought I'd be clear-headed enough to see past these sugar-coated fantasies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But then... I started to notice... there might be nothing inherently different between who I am now and who I was back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say that. You told the children yourself. Death is a solemn topic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, did I? I don't remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps it was just the lectures that I've got so used to giving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "How was procurement today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not too bad. The situation on the streets isn't very serious. The prices at the shops haven't gone up, though there were more city defense soldiers than usual, and the Sarkaz solders... they're not as secretive they used to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But everyone is pretending as if nothing has happened. Except... what used to be Norport. There is nothing left except the support structures extending from the surrounding districts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about those places?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to apologize to you again. I should never have dragged you into this. It's just... Lettou has his eyes on me, and every time I step out the door, I find myself followed by several ill-meaning men.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had no choice but to make a gamble\u2014that you are not on their watchlist yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm glad to do my part for Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that the places you told me about were all pretty quiet. I used the passwords, but no one answered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... Maybe they've already given up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, they are all stronger than I am. Much stronger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I've found a letter. It should be for you, so I didn't open it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... No, this isn't their handwriting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "The letter has practically all the information on the Self-Salvation Corps' communications.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?! But... how could that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a threat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "They... They know us like the back of their hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then... What should we do, Lady Golding?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Molly, I'll have another list of places for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been to these bases myself, but having analyzed the flow of information... they should be there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shouldn't take this risk. This goes against our established practices, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This information is important to the Self-Salvation Corps, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many lives are on the line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we must do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Molly... Just as I taught you, watch out for anyone who could be tailing you. Whether they are Sarkaz or not, do not let your guard down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look for a girl called Clovisia there or anyone who can get in contact with her. Tell them that the entire intelligence network has been exposed. They must evacuate immediately!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Golding, where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "To Lettou's office.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will try to buy as much time as I can for the rest of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, I'll be fine. I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just hope I'm stronger than I think I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
