    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, I had a dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw... the city shrouded in dark clouds, and bloodstained Sarkaz flags flew above every building. Outside the city... Originium grew everywhere my eyes could see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw a rusted throne towering above the lands. The masses kneeled before it, crying tears stained in black. I saw the person on the throne wave their arm, and the shouts that followed pierced the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet, in the shadow of the throne, the cowering men lifted their heads ever so slightly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I felt what they felt...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know how to describe it... It was so all over the place, so stifled...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could only make out what was on the surface. That pain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and hatred.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who was that on the throne...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this the future that the collective souls of the Sarkaz foresaw? Or is this... the duty of the King of Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Theresa have this dream? Could this be... the sights she is looking forward to now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it can't be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, this dream... It doesn't mean anything, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You're just exhausted.;It's just a dream.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, it was... just a dream...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Dr. Kal'tsit better?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hard to say. Her body... was frail to start with, and her wounds are deep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shining has attempted several solutions, but all of them were limited in their effectiveness. She has yet to awaken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mon3tr seems to be slowly repairing itself. Likewise, we do not have any idea how well it will recover, or whether it can actually even recover.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... At the Defense Forces' command tower, if only I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#18$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Everyone did their best.;None of us expected to see Theresis there.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never once imagined that Dr. Kal'tsit would one day be wounded this badly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "She always solved all our problems like they were nothing. She gave us the best advice for every situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's Dr. Kal'tsit. I've never even seen her look tired!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "(Takes Amiya's hand)",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. I will bear the responsibilities that are mine to bear. Rhodes Island's mission here is far from over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I want to see Dr. Kal'tsit one more time. May I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it's just sitting there by her bed for a short while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rather than staying with the wounded, you two have more important work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Closure wants you to know that she has finished analyzing the data from the command tower.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clovisia is calling a meeting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to reevaluate the situation in Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "War has broken out.;Our initial plans have failed.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then please tell us what our step should be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
